<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<topic id="6204c862-a7b7-45a5-b870-08b3771a7308" revisionNumber="1">
  <developerConceptualDocument
    xmlns="http://ddue.schemas.microsoft.com/authoring/2003/5"
    xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink">

    <introduction>
      <para>The <legacyBold>scheduler</legacyBold> element stores configuration for one instance of the <codeEntityReference qualifyHint="false">T:DemiCode.Scheduling.Scheduler</codeEntityReference> class. It is primarily 
                a collection of tasks and schedules. The schedules can be either strong-typed
                schedules, representing built-in schedules, or custom schedules. Supported elements are shown below.</para>
    </introduction>

   
                                    
 
<section>
  <content>
   <code language="xml">
            &lt;scheduler name=&quot;myscheduler&quot;&gt;
                &lt;tasks&gt; ... &lt;/tasks&gt;
                &lt;loggers&gt; ... &lt;/loggers&gt; 
                &lt;schedule name="name1" type=&quot;...&quot; /&gt;
                &lt;OneShotSchedule name="name2" /&gt;
                &lt;IntervalSchedule name="name3" /&gt;
                &lt;IntervalCountedSchedule name="name4" /&gt;
                &lt;WeeklySchedule name="name5" /&gt;
            &lt;/scheduler&gt;
            </code>
  </content>
</section>
   
            
<section>
	<title>Attributes and Elements</title>
	<content>
		
		<table>
		<title>Attributes</title>
			<tableHeader>
				<row>
					<entry>Attribute</entry>
					<entry>Description</entry>
				</row>
			</tableHeader>
			
                        <row>
                            <entry>
                                <legacyBold>name</legacyBold>
                            </entry>
                            <entry>
                                
                                    Name of the scheduler configuration element. This value can later be used to reference the desired configuration when
                                    creating instances of the <codeEntityReference qualifyHint="false">T:DemiCode.Scheduling.Scheduler</codeEntityReference>.
                            </entry>
                        </row>
                    </table>
                
                
		<table>
		<title>Child Elements</title>
			<tableHeader>
				<row>
					<entry>Element</entry>
					<entry>Description</entry>
				</row>
			</tableHeader>
			
			
                        <row>
                            <entry><legacyBold><link xlink:href="f592f4a7-ecd8-4de0-949c-8c45dcf87b59">tasks</link> </legacyBold></entry>
                            <entry>
                                
                                    A collection of tasks to execute on schedule. This element is optional.
                                    
                            </entry>
                        </row>
                        <row>
                            <entry><legacyBold><link xlink:href="a82cc791-a9fe-45a3-8135-4bb30f8af656">loggers</link> </legacyBold></entry>
                            <entry>
                                
                                    A collection of loggers. This element is optional.
                                    
                            </entry>
                        </row>
                        <row>
                            <entry><legacyBold><link xlink:href="c7ca10b4-86cf-4f36-a961-826165893353">schedule</link> </legacyBold></entry>
                            <entry>
                                
                                    A custom or third-party schedule.
                                    
                            </entry>
                        </row>
                        <row>
                            <entry>
                                <legacyBold><link xlink:href="2d9af591-a413-41ca-9c27-4de9f6eae086">OneShotSchedule</link> </legacyBold>
                            </entry>
                            <entry>
                                
                                    Represents the built-in <codeEntityReference qualifyHint="false">T:DemiCode.Scheduling.Schedules.OneShotSchedule</codeEntityReference> schedule.
                            </entry>
                        </row>
                        <row>
                            <entry>
                                <legacyBold><link xlink:href="124cbec8-fb1b-4074-a861-84173910a32c">IntervalSchedule</link> </legacyBold>
                            </entry>
                            <entry>
                                
                                Represents the built-in <codeEntityReference qualifyHint="false">T:DemiCode.Scheduling.Schedules.IntervalSchedule</codeEntityReference> schedule.
                            </entry>
                        </row>
                        <row>
                            <entry>
                                <legacyBold><link xlink:href="57ebeffe-d9b1-4b6c-84a2-36657f326a57">IntervalCountedSchedule</link> </legacyBold>
                            </entry>
                            <entry>
                                
                                    Represents the built-in <codeEntityReference qualifyHint="false">T:DemiCode.Scheduling.Schedules.IntervalCountedSchedule</codeEntityReference> schedule.
                            </entry>
                        </row>
                        <row>
                            <entry>
                                <legacyBold><link xlink:href="d283d9a7-faef-42f8-ab24-8f479cafd4fc">WeeklySchedule</link> </legacyBold>
                            </entry>
                            <entry>
                                
                                    Represents the built-in <codeEntityReference qualifyHint="false">T:DemiCode.Scheduling.Schedules.WeeklySchedule</codeEntityReference> schedule.
                            </entry>
                        </row>
                    </table>
  </content>
</section>

            
    

